model r1
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input on_: bool
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
move pw: transfers
  on w
  when on_
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  on_ = true "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
ask a_after: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with on_ = false
ask a_before: bal(konto, 2026-03-05) with on_ = false
ask a_pay: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with on_ = false, pay = 200.00 PLN
ask a_payb: bal(konto, 2026-03-05) with pay = 200.00 PLN
ask a_wb: bal(konto, 2026-03-05) with w = 2026-03-12, pay = 200.00 PLN
ask f_mv: flows(pw, 2026-03) with on_ = false, pay = 200.00 PLN
ask f_pl: flows(konto, 2026-03) with on_ = false, pay = 200.00 PLN
ask c_mv: count(m in transfers over 2026-03) with on_ = false, pay = 200.00 PLN
ask p_b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-03-01 with on_ = false
ask k_b: check bal(konto, 2026-03-31) == bal(konto, 2026-01-31) with on_ = false
ask x_b: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with on_ = false
